# Binary files must never have line endings rewritten. Without this, committing
# public/dividend-investors-toolkit.pdf on Windows warns "LF will be replaced by
# CRLF the next time Git touches it" -- and on the next checkout Git would do
# exactly that, injecting CR bytes into the PDF stream and corrupting the file
# that /free-guide hands to every reader.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
